(:id "port/python/vt/widening" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/pythontable/widening_test.go: TestPythonVtWidening/ladder (13 declarations — the ten integer widths, a ranged int64, bits(12) and float64 — × 15 wire kinds, with top-bit, small, NaN and infinity payloads, through the straight-line load and the descriptor walk under both pins: verdict, value, widened count and saved bytes are internal/tablewire's, and a refused read leaves the caller's report and buffer untouched), TestPythonVtWidening/ladder-widens, TestPythonVtWidening/sites (the one _accepts/_read pair at an arm, an array element and a map key: a widening reads and counts one, a narrowing refuses kind_mismatch with no value, and the float rung decides on the kind pair, not the codec string), TestPythonVtWidening/manifest (k1_as_k2 held to reports.txt; the rows resting on the fixed form, packet types in tables, lists or maps asserted un-carried)" "internal/codegen/pythontable/widening_test.go: TestPythonVtWideningNegativeControl (widen.py broken in a copy, one rule at a time: signed-ladder, rungs-closed, widened-count, narrowing, float-rung; each red on the cell it decides)" "make python-vt-widening-negative-control (make/negative-controls.json row python-vt-widening)") :tested-revision "1b681f54d24eae1f3098e0f30b484ca545f82f9d" :note "2026-11-15: a field accepts every narrower kind on its own signedness ladder, decoded at the writer's width with the wire kind's sign, held to the declared range and counted widened; a float64 field accepts a finite float32 exactly and a non-finite source refuses non_finite_float; the kind pair alone decides and every other pair, narrowings included, refuses kind_mismatch. Run on Linux x86-64 under the pinned CPython 3.15.2 and 3.11.18 (make dist-python) with mypy 1.18.2 strict over the generated package and the runtime, SCHEMA_SLOW=1, -tags schema_leg_python, at this revision; the whole pythontable package passed, as did make generated-current and make roadmap-check. The construct loaders for arms, elements and map keys land with the cards that carry those kinds, so the corpus rows resting on them are asserted un-carried here.")
